+# Audit evidence
+
+The files in this directory were created by the independent reviewer. Each
+bounded command log made through `run_logged.sh` begins with the exact
+shell-escaped command and ends with its exit status.
+
+The clean reconstruction workspace is `/tmp/audit-work/129-minPath-audit`.
