+```
+
+It exited 0 with final `.K`, `NoExc`, and exit code 0:
+[`stage3-krun-concrete-tests.log`](./evidence/stage3-krun-concrete-tests.log).
+
+The Haskell proof definition was built from source with:
+
+```text
